(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-07","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["老街路面还泛着雨光。港务[[patrol|巡查]]人员在警员安排下打开后院[[access|通道]]，房东指出正[[entrance|入口]]和储物间。我们留在警戒线外，程雾确认照片中的灯架，老陈认出一条通向旧港的水沟。那沟沿着搬运[[corridor|走廊]]延伸，能绕回B库后门。民警把位置标好，没有让老陈去试锁。我站在停着机器的窗外，第一次觉得雨后的街道静得不对。","灯亮起来，警员从印刷间找到疑似[[counterfeit|伪造的]]清运通知，所盖[[seal|印章]]与港务样本有差别。桌上还放着修改事故展文的[[manuscript|手稿]]，背面也是档案页码格。每份[[document|文件]]都被拍照，卷筒里最后一张纸垂到地上。忽然，后屋传出两下轻撞，停一会儿又是三下。房东说那门后通地下储藏室，平时锁着。何警官让我们退远，叫赵启的名字，门里终于传来含混的应答。","警员控制看守，打开铁门，被当作[[hostage|人质]]的赵启蜷在柱边。[[rescue|救援]]人员下去接他，他被[[confine|关在]]这里数天，水瓶已经空了。担架抬上来时，医护检查呼吸，给他吸[[oxygen|氧气]]。灰外套上有蓝色擦痕，我想起老板娘画下的门框，伸出手却又收回来。程雾把我往一边拉，让担架先通过，赵启妻子正在街口赶来。","赵启认出我，嘴唇动了动，只说出‘对不起’。我曾准备了一整页问题，这时只能[[reassure|安慰]]他先治疗。医护清理腕上的[[wound|伤口]]，换上干净[[bandage|绷带]]。老陈给他妻子打电话，说人活着，后半句却哽住。我的[[companion|同伴]]程雾收起相机，替他拉好外套：照片已经帮我们找到人，不必再留下他最狼狈的样子。赵启抓住妻子的手，终于不再盯着那扇地下室门。","警方将两名清运队人员[[detain|扣留调查]]，收走印章、设备和车内物品作为[[evidence|证据]]。赵启作了简短[[statement|陈述]]，确认信是他寄的，也说看守曾提到秦衡。说到这项[[accusation|指控]]时，他仍会发抖。上救护车前，他看见我掌心的钥匙，突然挣着要起身：‘C库钟座里有转存便条。操作簿在港务楼地下旧柜，不在钟里。别让他们先把那张条子毁了。’"],"en":["Rain still shone on the old street. Under police direction, a port [[patrol|patrol]] officer opened the rear-yard [[access|access]] passage. The landlord indicated the main [[entrance|entrance]] and storeroom. We remained outside the cordon. Cheng confirmed the lamp frame in the photograph, while Chen recognized a drain leading to the old port. It ran beside a hauling [[corridor|corridor]] and could take someone back to B's rear door. An officer marked its position without asking Chen to try a lock. Outside the silent machines' window, the rain-washed street suddenly felt too quiet.","Lights came on. Officers found suspected [[counterfeit|counterfeit]] clearance notices whose [[seal|seal]] differed from the port sample. A [[manuscript|manuscript]] revising the accident display lay on the desk; its back also carried an archive page grid. Each [[document|document]] was photographed. The last sheet in a roll hung to the floor. Then two faint knocks came from the rear, followed after a pause by three more. The landlord said the door led to a normally locked basement storeroom. Officer He moved us back and called Zhao's name. At last a muffled voice answered.","Officers restrained the guards and opened the metal door. Zhao, held as a [[hostage|hostage]], crouched beside a pillar. A [[rescue|rescue]] team went down to collect him. His captors had chosen to [[confine|confine]] him there for several days, and his water bottle was empty. As the stretcher came up, medical staff checked his breathing and gave him [[oxygen|oxygen]]. Blue marks stained his grey coat. I remembered the door frame the owner had drawn and reached out, then stopped. Cheng pulled me aside to let the stretcher pass. Zhao's wife was arriving at the end of the street.","Zhao recognized me. His lips moved, but only 'I'm sorry' came out. I had prepared a whole page of questions; now I could only [[reassure|reassure]] him and ask him to accept treatment first. A medic cleaned the [[wound|wound]] on his wrist and applied a fresh [[bandage|bandage]]. Chen called Zhao's wife. 'He's alive,' he said, then his voice failed. My [[companion|companion]] Cheng put away her camera and straightened his coat. Photographs had helped us find him; we did not need another of his worst moment. Holding his wife's hand, he finally stopped staring at the basement door.","Police proceeded to [[detain|detain]] two clearance workers for investigation and collected stamps, equipment, and vehicle contents as [[evidence|evidence]]. In a brief [[statement|statement]], Zhao confirmed that he had mailed the letter and heard his guards mention Qin. He still trembled at that [[accusation|accusation]]. Before entering the ambulance, he saw the key in my palm and suddenly tried to sit up. 'There's a transfer note in C's bell base. The operating register is in an old basement cabinet in the port building, not in the bell. Don't let them destroy the note first.'"]});
